window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The first three books in the riveting new thriller series from <i>Wall Street Journal</i> and <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author L.T. Ryan. The Blake Brier books are gripping thrillers packed with twists, suspense, and nonstop action.</p> <p><b>Unmasked</b><br> Driven by a promise. Haunted by regret. They never saw him coming.</p> <p>A heinous crime pulls the FBI into a desperate search for answers. Blake Brier is sucked back into the life he left behind, caught in a deadly plot involving a hacktivist group turned terrorist organization. When it becomes personal, he’ll stop at nothing for the truth.</p> <p><b>Unleashed</b><br> A secret project has run its course—and its primary subject must be terminated.</p> <p>On a relaxing weekend in Vegas, Blake crosses paths with Haeli Becher, a woman on the run from the organization that created her. Her attackers will stop at nothing. Brier and his team will risk everything to save her—even if it costs them their lives.</p> <p><b>Uncharted</b><br> An old friend's call drags Brier into a dangerous rescue mission.</p> <p>When FBI Agent Andrew Harrison asks Brier to find his runaway niece, Brier agrees—but quickly realizes there's far more going on in the quiet New England town. Lives hang in the balance as Brier navigates deadly uncharted waters... and he might not make it back.</p> <p><b><i>Fans of Tom Clancy's Jack Ryan, Vince Flynn's Mitch Rapp, and Robert Ludlum's Jason Bourne will be glued to the Blake Brier series.</i></b></p>"; 
